### Public storefront read API — no auth, cacheable, locale fallback (servedLocale names the locale used)

### Everything the layout needs in one read
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/site?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### A page (or a draft with ?preview=<token> from POST …/pages/{id}/preview-token)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/pages/about-us?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Blog
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/posts?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&count=12
###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/posts?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&category=guides
###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/posts/quarterly-supply-budget?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/post-categories?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Home-page sections, in order (public, 60s cache + ETag)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/home-sections?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Banners that win each placement
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/banners?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&placement=HERO

### FAQ (+ FAQPage JSON-LD)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/faq?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Menus resolved (labels in lang, hrefs, broken links dropped)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/menus/MAIN?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Live policy, or an older version
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/policies/RETURNS?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/policies/RETURNS?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&v=1

### Sitemap entries and redirects
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/sitemap?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/storefront/redirects?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&path=/content/old-slug
